I leave the error that I was having, and the solution in case someone stumbles upon it, as googling it did not show many results

> 'VITE_MOCK_API' is not recognized as an internal or external command

 It seems that this syntax where you set up an environment variable before running the command is not recognized by windows PowerShell (see this [SO Question](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/1420719/powershell-setting-an-environment-variable-for-a-single-command-only)). The solution is to remove the env variable (change the "dev" script inside the `package.json` to `"dev": "npm run make-i18n && remix vite:dev"` and then use a ".env" file to set the `VITE_MOCK_API` variable to false

